{"id":"n15452-2-4","stage":3,"title":"발끝 · 边儿","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15452-2-4-1","ko":"디자인 실력이 아주 많이 늘었구나.","zh":"你的设计水平进步真大啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"디자인","meaning":"设计","explanation":"디자인：设计","readings":[{"term":"디자인","audio":"/audio/a333d62d9be4e2be66d3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54448","senseId":"1","lemma":"디자인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"실력이","meaning":"实力，能力","explanation":"실력：实力，能力；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"실력","audio":"/audio/e709c7a9c091424d582a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66283","senseId":"1","lemma":"실력","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아주","meaning":"非常，极其，很","explanation":"아주：非常，极其，很","readings":[{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72484","senseId":"1","lemma":"아주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"늘었구나.","meaning":"增长，提高","explanation":"늘다：增长，提高；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"늘다","audio":"/audio/0a9915cd5915474e927c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64492","senseId":"4","lemma":"늘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"a333d62d9be4e2be","term":"디자인","zh":"设计","audio":"/audio/a333d62d9be4e2be66d3.mp3","entryId":"54448","definition":"服装、工业产品、建筑等具有实用目的的作品设计或图案。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"e709c7a9c091424d","term":"실력","zh":"实力，能力","audio":"/audio/e709c7a9c091424d582a.mp3","entryId":"66283","definition":"可以完成某事的能力。","pronunciation":["실력"]},{"id":"dc76f888ddfaef28","term":"아주","zh":"非常，极其，很","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3","entryId":"72484","definition":"表示程度相当高，远远超出了一般程度。","pronunciation":["아주"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"0a9915cd5915474e","term":"늘다","zh":"增长，提高","audio":"/audio/0a9915cd5915474e927c.mp3","entryId":"64492","definition":"才能或能力等比以前更多或变好。","pronunciation":["늘다"]}],"audio":"/audio/79fbe39637435f1c5d96.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15452-2-4-2","ko":"그래도 아직 우리나라 최고 디자이너들의 발끝도 못 따라가는 실력이에요.","zh":"不过现在的水平还是远远比不上我们国家最顶尖的设计师们。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래도","meaning":"“그리하여도(即便如此)”的缩略语。","explanation":"그래도：“그리하여도(即便如此)”的缩略语。","readings":[{"term":"그래도","audio":"/audio/82bd547e58bb6509909c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36264","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아직","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우리나라","meaning":"我们；国，国家","explanation":"우리：我们；나라：国，国家","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"},{"term":"나라","audio":"/audio/02faec8ed1c75703dcd3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"2","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"29699","senseId":"1","lemma":"나라","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"최고","meaning":"最；最佳","explanation":"최고：最；最佳","readings":[{"term":"최고","audio":"/audio/97b8be84b3d009c4b9b1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47976","senseId":"1","lemma":"최고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"디자이너들의","meaning":"设计师","explanation":"디자이너：设计师；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"디자이너","audio":"/audio/81223d1051d845aa20ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15059","senseId":"1","lemma":"디자이너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"발끝도","meaning":"边儿","explanation":"발끝：边儿；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"발끝","audio":"/audio/a219a5e9b19f4a42bc71.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15452","senseId":"2","lemma":"발끝","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못","meaning":"没达到一定水平或状态，或者不适合或不足为标准。","explanation":"못：没达到一定水平或状态，或者不适合或不足为标准。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"3","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"따라가는","meaning":"跟上","explanation":"따라가다：跟上；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"따라가다","audio":"/audio/f4444e8f14d0d164db53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61105","senseId":"2","lemma":"따라가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"실력이에요.","meaning":"实力，能力","explanation":"실력：实力，能力；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"실력","audio":"/audio/e709c7a9c091424d582a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66283","senseId":"1","lemma":"실력","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"82bd547e58bb6509","term":"그래도","zh":"“그리하여도(即便如此)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/82bd547e58bb6509909c.mp3","entryId":"36264","definition":"“그리하여도(即便如此)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己在内的一些人。一般对没有自己身份地位高的人使用。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"02faec8ed1c75703","term":"나라","zh":"国，国家","audio":"/audio/02faec8ed1c75703dcd3.mp3","entryId":"29699","definition":"拥有一定领土与主权的、由居民组成的社会性组织。","pronunciation":["나라"]},{"id":"97b8be84b3d009c4","term":"최고","zh":"最；最佳","audio":"/audio/97b8be84b3d009c4b9b1.mp3","entryId":"47976","definition":"最好或最出色的。","pronunciation":["최ː고","췌ː고"]},{"id":"81223d1051d845aa","term":"디자이너","zh":"设计师","audio":"/audio/81223d1051d845aa20ba.mp3","entryId":"15059","definition":"专门设计服装、工业产品、建筑等具有实用目的的作品或绘制相关图纸的人。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"a219a5e9b19f4a42","term":"발끝","zh":"边儿","audio":"/audio/a219a5e9b19f4a42bc71.mp3","entryId":"15452","definition":"(喻义)某人具有的能力或心态的最低水平。","pronunciation":["발끋"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"没达到一定水平或状态，或者不适合或不足为标准。","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"没达到一定水平或状态，或者不适合或不足为标准。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"f4444e8f14d0d164","term":"따라가다","zh":"跟上","audio":"/audio/f4444e8f14d0d164db53.mp3","entryId":"61105","definition":"几乎达到相同的程度或水平。","pronunciation":["따라가다"]},{"id":"e709c7a9c091424d","term":"실력","zh":"实力，能力","audio":"/audio/e709c7a9c091424d582a.mp3","entryId":"66283","definition":"可以完成某事的能力。","pronunciation":["실력"]}],"audio":"/audio/9671089e93cd0fed88bb.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.909,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15452","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":104,"sequenceScore":2.7357,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["不过现在的水平还是远远比不上我们国家最顶尖的设计师们。","你的设计水平进步真大啊。","孩子在学校老是惹麻烦。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你的设计水平进步真大啊。","孩子在学校老是惹麻烦。","不过现在的水平还是远远比不上我们国家最顶尖的设计师们。"],"answer":2}]}
